1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,028
Every group of people likes to believe that its story is the most important story ever told.

2
00:00:06,028 --> 00:00:08,841
Greeks say history began in Athens.

3
00:00:08,841 --> 00:00:12,382
Chinese nationalists say it began with the Yellow Emperor.

4
00:00:12,382 --> 00:00:17,539
The Aztecs believed the sun would not rise without their sacrifices.

